  "note": "do/does vs be. Gap on auxiliary or negative form. · 2026-08-29 smoke: intro names be vs do (C11); authored aux chips, no didn't/wasn't; Use F3-trimmed onto taught verbs; D3 job note stripped; James → Martin; ready → tired. Flags: Otázky a zápor on card 0 (C14); bold the helper not the sentence (C13). Inspected (Telegram).",
